cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in published work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: ClaudeR
abstract: >-
  An R package and MCP server that connects AI agents to a live RStudio or
  Python session, so the agent runs code where the data and fitted models
  already are. Every line it executes is logged and attributed, checkpoints
  make steps reversible, and several agents can share one session under a
  consensus gate. Includes protocols for manuscript auditing, systematic
  review screening, and reproducible session logs.
